### Marcar la cuota - El participante dice que ya pagó
POST {{url}}/pools/{{poolPublicId}}/payments/mark-paid
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "participantPublicId": "{{participantPublicId}}",
  "month": "2026-09-01"
}

>> ./pools_payments_mark_paid.200.json

### Marcar la cuota - Otra vez el mismo mes, que no cambia nada
POST {{url}}/pools/{{poolPublicId}}/payments/mark-paid
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "participantPublicId": "{{participantPublicId}}",
  "month": "2026-09-01"
}

### Marcar la cuota - De quien cobra ese mes
POST {{url}}/pools/{{poolPublicId}}/payments/mark-paid
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "participantPublicId": "{{participantPublicId}}",
  "month": "2026-09-01"
}

>> ./pools_payments_mark_paid_beneficiary.400.json

### Marcar la cuota - Un mes que todavía no ha llegado
POST {{url}}/pools/{{poolPublicId}}/payments/mark-paid
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "participantPublicId": "{{participantPublicId}}",
  "month": "2099-01-01"
}

>> ./pools_payments_mark_paid_future_month.400.json

### Marcar la cuota - Un mes que no es de esta porra
POST {{url}}/pools/{{poolPublicId}}/payments/mark-paid
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "participantPublicId": "{{participantPublicId}}",
  "month": "2020-01-01"
}

>> ./pools_payments_mark_paid_wrong_month.400.json

### Marcar la cuota - Alguien que no está en la porra
POST {{url}}/pools/{{poolPublicId}}/payments/mark-paid
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "participantPublicId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "month": "2026-09-01"
}

>> ./pools_payments_mark_paid_unknown_participant.400.json

### Mis cuotas - Las que tiene registradas un participante
GET {{url}}/pools/{{poolPublicId}}/payments/participant/{{participantPublicId}}

>> ./pools_payments_by_participant.200.json
